%% archify:artifact lifecycle
%% archify:elements life-delivery-stages, art-html
%% archify:note States are the exact stage values reported by reportDeliveryFailure and the commit path in archify/bin/archify.mjs.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> input
    input --> prepare: specification parsed
    prepare --> render: candidate directory and snapshot created
    render --> check: renderer exited 0
    check --> receipt: all artifact checks passed
    receipt --> commit: receipt built
    commit --> [*]: candidate renamed onto the target
    input --> failed: unreadable or invalid JSON
    prepare --> failed: unsafe output path or unwritable directory
    render --> failed: renderer diagnostics
    check --> failed: artifact check failed
    receipt --> failed: unreadable candidate or receipt
    commit --> failed: rename rejected
    failed --> [*]: previous artifact preserved
